{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"俯意象"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"俯意象"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"俯范畴","text":"俯范畴"}},{"Plain":"仍是意象, 称之为俯意象.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>意象 $\\mathcal C$ 的所有俯意象构成函子\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Cat},\\ X\\mapsto\\mathcal C_{/X}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}